WARNING: in UHF/HFLD calculations, by default the total energy is chosen   
         as the sum of the UHF energy (SCF energy) and the LD correction. 


WARNING: Post HF methods need fully converged wavefunctions
  ===> : Setting SCFConvForced true
         You can overwrite this default with %scf ConvForced false 


WARNING: PNO calculations with unrestricted orbitals require UNOs
  ===> : Switching on UNOs

WARNING: UseCISUpdate is  only available for RHF calculations...
  ===> : Setting UseCISUpdate = false 

WARNING: The chosen methods will break translational/rotational symmetry
  ===> : Will NOT project out the translational and rotational degrees of freedom
         of the Hessians, in case Hessians are calculated!

WARNING: The chosen methods will break translational symmetry
  ===> : Will NOT exploit translational invariance of the Hessians,
         in case Hessians are calculated!

WARNING: The chosen methods will break translational symmetry
  ===> : Will NOT make the numerical gradients translationally invariant,
         in case numerical gradients are calculated!

